# Alembic revision scripts live here.
#
# The baseline migration in this directory was generated by Alembic itself with
#     .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m alembic revision --autogenerate
# against an EMPTY scratch database, so it contains op.create_table() for all 30
# tables. It was then stamped (not run) against the real database, which already
# had the tables from the bulk load.
#
# Do not edit it by hand. If it drifts from the models, regenerate it.
